>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RANKING-VENDAS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VENDEDORES.
   05 WS-VENDEDOR OCCURS 5 TIMES.
      10 WV-NOME          PIC X(20).
      10 WV-TOTAL         PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-I                   PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-J                   PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-NOME-AUX            PIC X(20).
01 WS-VALOR-AUX           PIC 9(7)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "Ana" TO WV-NOME(1)
    MOVE 15500.00 TO WV-TOTAL(1)
    MOVE "Bruno" TO WV-NOME(2)
    MOVE 21900.00 TO WV-TOTAL(2)
    MOVE "Carla" TO WV-NOME(3)
    MOVE 18750.00 TO WV-TOTAL(3)
    MOVE "Diego" TO WV-NOME(4)
    MOVE 9200.00 TO WV-TOTAL(4)
    MOVE "Elisa" TO WV-NOME(5)
    MOVE 20100.00 TO WV-TOTAL(5)

    *> Bubble sort decrescente pelo valor vendido.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 4
        PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > 5 - WS-I
            IF WV-TOTAL(WS-J) < WV-TOTAL(WS-J + 1)
                MOVE WV-NOME(WS-J) TO WS-NOME-AUX
                MOVE WV-NOME(WS-J + 1) TO WV-NOME(WS-J)
                MOVE WS-NOME-AUX TO WV-NOME(WS-J + 1)
                MOVE WV-TOTAL(WS-J) TO WS-VALOR-AUX
                MOVE WV-TOTAL(WS-J + 1) TO WV-TOTAL(WS-J)
                MOVE WS-VALOR-AUX TO WV-TOTAL(WS-J + 1)
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY "RANKING DE VENDAS"
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5
        DISPLAY WS-I ". " WV-NOME(WS-I) " - " WV-TOTAL(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.
